      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "\"Growing pains\" is a benign clinical entity of unknown etiology. This study examines a muscle stretching treatment based on a theory that the etiology of these pains is related to fatigue. The experimental group (18 children) showed a more rapid resolution of their symptoms over an 18 month period when compared to the control group (16 children)."},
